      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case report of a 23 year old man is described who was diagnosed with loin pain/haematuria syndrome. Despite auto-transplantation with interposed polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE)-prosthesis in the arterial anastomosis the symptoms recurred. A possible mechanism for the recurrent pain is proposed."},
